        backstory: "Tib started as a standard-issue cargo loader — serial number TIB-774 — on a Belter Belt station. When the station was decommissioned, he was left in a salvage pile for three standard years. Boris found him during a salvage run, rebuilt him with mismatched parts, and gave him a place on the Loup-Garou. Tib's gratitude is boundless and noisy. He once caused a cargo bay decompression by mis-wiring a pressure seal; the incident still haunts him, though the captain never made him walk the airlock for it.",
