                content: "The cargo bay decompression on the Loup-Garou was Tib's fault. He was trying to impress Boris by re-routing the pressure manifold without supervision and cross-wired the emergency vent. He ran and hid while the bay decompressed, and Boris took the blame, claiming it was a parts failure. Tib has never confessed because he's terrified the captain will space him.",
